// GIFT REACTIONS: BASIC
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Love": "Thank you, @! This is brilliant!$7",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Like": "Ooh, this is swell! Thanks, @.$4",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Dislike": "I'm sorry, what?$3",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Hate": "@, why would you give me this?$2",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Neutral": "Thanks, @.$0",
// GIFT REACTIONS: GENERAL 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Negative": "Uhm, okay. Thanks, I guess?$2", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Positive": "This is awesome! Thanks, @!$1", 
// GIFT REACTION: STARDROP TEA 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.StardropTea": "Call it 'Port Drake Stereotypical', but I LOVE, LOVE, LOVE this. It tastes like a dessert drink! Thank you!$1",
// GIFT REACTION: RUBY RING 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.ESRubyRing": "This is very pretty, but it's not mine. Sorry, @.$3",
// GIFT REACTIONS: CATEGORIES 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.ArtisanalGoods": "You MADE this? From scratch? And you're sharing it with me? Thank you!$1", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Minerals": "This is beautiful! I love stones, especially from different places. Thanks!$1", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Gems": "I love gemstones. Not because they're expensive, but I love the colors and the meanings people from different places ascribe to them.$23", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Dairy": "This will almost certainty give me a tummy ache, but that won't stop me!$22", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Fruit": "Oh, I love fruit! I can use this to make Ginger Beer. Thank you, @!$1", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Vegetables": "Did you grow this yourself? Thanks, @! Nothing better than fresh veggies!$10", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Flowers": "Oh, this is SO pretty. Thank you, @.$4", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Fish": "Nice! I love seafood, I'm already plotting what I can cook with this. Thank you, @.$6", 
"Coriander.GiftReject.Alcohol": "I don't drink, @. I had a bad relationship with alcohol on tour and I'm very committed to staying sober.$2", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Books": "Oh, nice! I'll have a read and then get back to you. Should we start a mini book club where we mostly gossip?$10", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Sushi": "I. Love. Sushi. It is my FAVORITE. Thank you, @.$7", 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Seafood": "I love seafood, this is excellent! Thank you, @.$7", 
// GIFT REACTIONS: LOVES 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.PrismaticShard": "@, This is the most beautiful thing I've ever seen - what a thoughtful gift, thank you so much. I'll treasure it.$4",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.GreenTea": "I LOVE tea! I collect all different kinds from as many different places as I can. Thank you for this, @!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.GingerBeer": "Oh my gosh, you ended up making Ginger Beer? I'm so excited to try it! Thank you for engaging in my hobbies with me, @.$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.ZuZuPizza": "Now THIS is how proper 'za is made! Thank you, @, I can tell you followed my recipe!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.ZuZuBagel": "@, this is BOMB. Classic Zuzu city fare. Love it. I'm so glad you made it and decided to share!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.ZuZuCheesecake": "Oh my gosh, @! This takes like home, looks like you got it perfect - thank you for sharing with me!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.ZuzuClamChowder": "Oh, @! I'm so glad you made this, I hope it feels as homey and nostalgic to you as it does to me.$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.SalmonDinner": "I've had a lot of fish before, but the salmon here is UNMATCHED compared to elsewhere!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.FriedEel": "I think people are largely turned off by eel, but I think it's delicious - especially fried up like this!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.SpicyEel": "I think people are largely turned off by eel, but I think it's delicious - especially when it's spicy!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.FishnChips": "Not to lean into Port Drake stereotypes or anything, but I LOVE a good fish n' chip. Thanks, @!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.DragonRoll": "Dragon Rolls combine my two favorite things. Eel and sushi! With a fantastic sauce, to boot. Thanks, @!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.EelPie": "Eel Pie is a staple food in Port Drake. It's a lot to get used to, but eel was just a very common protein!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.EelBowl": "Eel Bowls are staple food in Port Drake. It's a lot to get used to, but eel was just a very common protein!$1",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.StarmiteToast": "Starmite brings me back to my childhood. It was a staple breakfast growing up. Thanks, @!$1",
// GIFT REACTIONS: LIKES 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.DinerCoffee": "Is this Val's mug?$14",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.CherryPie": "Oh, I love cherries. This smells great, thanks @!$11",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.ChocolateOrange": "These are the BEST. I don't know where Rosa gets them from.$10",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Emerald": "You would think a red stone would represent love, but nope! Passion and romance are encouraged by emeralds.$0",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Aquamarine": "Aquamarine is considered a healing stone. That feels right, based on the soothing blue color.$0",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Ruby": "Rubies are often used in protective talismans! I've heard adventurers carry them for good luck.$0",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Topaz": "Yellow topaz is super uncommon, usually it's blue! More of a turquoise color, like Aquamarine.$0",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Jade": "Jade breaks easily. Supposedly, when the stone cracks, it's successfully warded off a bad omen.$0",
"Coriander.GiftReaction.Diamond": "Diamonds are a girl's best friend! Except not really; the manufactured ones are just as good as the mined ones.$0",
// GIFT REACTIONS: DISLIKES 
"Coriander.GiftReaction.AutographedPhoto": "I have a weird relationship with autographs. Sorry, @. I like Rodney, but I don't want this.$2", 
// GIFT REACTIONS: HATES 
"Coriander.GiftReject.StygiumOre": "I know you're not supposed to touch that stuff, so I'm pretty hurt you're trying to give it to me.$2",
"Coriander.GiftReject.CursedCorianderDoll": "Ew, no. I don't want that creepy little thing! Get it away!$37", 
"Coriander.GiftReject.CirrusBrandedToothbrush": "I thought we threw all of these out! Ew!$21", 
"Coriander.GiftReject.InTheKitchenWithCirrus": "I gave you the copy with my notes in it, why are you pulling these out of the garbage?$26", 
"Coriander.GiftReject.CloudJojaCola": "That stuff'll rot your teeth out! No! And I don't like seeing my face on the can, either!$25", 
"Coriander.GiftReject.JojaCola": "That stuff'll rot your teeth out! No!$25", 
"Coriander.GiftReject.Pizza": "This isn't the real thing. I know Gus tries, but it doesn't hit right.$20", 
// ROMANTIC ITEM REJECTIONS 
"Coriander.GiftRejection.Bouquet": "%Coriander is not interested in a Bouquet. Maybe you can show your interest in a different way...",
"Coriander.GiftRejection.MermaidPendant": "%Coriander is not interested in getting married until the mystery of the Deep Dark is resolved.",
// MOVIES
"Coriander.BraveLittleSapling.1": "This looks pretty cute.$0",
"Coriander.BraveLittleSapling.2": "...$3",
"Coriander.BraveLittleSapling.3": "Not really my thing, but the music was really good!$1",
"Coriander.NaturalWonders.1": "A nature documentary? Ain't nothin' but mammals, I guess!$1",
"Coriander.NaturalWonders.2": "...$13",
"Coriander.NaturalWonders.3": "That was alright! The narrator had a really nice voice - dude can't pronounce 'penguins' though, what the heck?$20",
"Coriander.PrairieKing.1": "Oh, this is my speed. A handsome protagonist and lots of action!$1",
"Coriander.PrairieKing.2": "This soundtrack is AWESOME.$14",
"Coriander.PrairieKing.3": "I'm so pumped up. Thanks for seeing this with me, @.$22",
"Coriander.Wumbus.1": "I do like sci-fi, but usually only when it's mixed with horror.$17",
"Coriander.Wumbus.2": "...$3",
"Coriander.Wumbus.3": "That was cuter than I expected, and the music was alright.$1",
"Coriander.Mysterium.1": "I know Val really loves this one, and I know it's horror-adjacent. I'm excited.$1",
"Coriander.Mysterium.2": "I feel like I lost the plot, got it back for a few minutes, and then lost it again.$18",
"Coriander.Mysterium.3": "So at least I definitely get what Val meant when they said 'it doesn't make any sense, until it does'...$17",
"Coriander.ItHowlsInTheRain.1": "YES! Finally, a horror flick is showing! I'm so pumped!$22",
"Coriander.ItHowlsInTheRain.2": "I have a couple of theories on what the monster could be, but there could still be a twist...$3",
"Coriander.ItHowlsInTheRain.3": "That was SO good. Thanks for bringing me along, @. Let's do more horror nights in the future!$11",
"Coriander.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.1": "Aw, these kinds of movies are feel-good fodder but that's alright.$13",
"Coriander.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.2": "The music is the same across all of these wintertime movies, isn't it?$20",
"Coriander.MiracleAtColdstarRanch.3": "That was very cute. but I feel like I've seen it already even though I know I haven't.$10",
"Coriander.ZuzuCityExpress.1": "I appreciate an old-fashioned movie.$0",
"Coriander.ZuzuCityExpress.2": "This doesn't seem like it aged well, actually.$2",
"Coriander.ZuzuCityExpress.3": "That was cool, in an 'I acknowledge it's dated but,' kinda way.$3",
// EGG FESTIVAL 
"Coriander.spring13.False.1": "They didn't have anything like this in Port Drake, but who am I to turn down a bunch of egg-based food? Especially deviled eggs, oh man. I hope Gus makes a bunch.$1",
"Coriander.spring13.False.2": "Can give or take the actual egg hunt part of this whole shindig, honestly. But the punch? The decorations? The food? This is all so cute!$4",
"Coriander.spring13.False.3": "I know it might be draining to attend festivals every year, but as someone who didn't have the opportunity for stuff like this on the road, I really love it.$7",
"Coriander.spring13.True.1": "Nothing is better than watching you beat a bunch of children in a game, Superstar. Go git 'em.$4",
"Coriander.spring13.True.2": "Love you, Superstar! You have fun, I'll be over here. Snacking, living my best life.$6",
"Coriander.spring13.True.3": "How many of those hats have you collected from winning this thing...? Can we redistribute them to %pet and %horse?$3",
// FLOWER DANCE 
"Coriander.spring24.False.1": "The dancing, the music, this whole vibe - it's so nice. I know it might seem cheesy to you by now, but we don't have this in Port Drake OR Zuzu.$4",
"Coriander.spring24.False.2": "Think I should ask someone to dance, @? I went through the trouble of getting dressed up, I want to participate!$1",
"Coriander.spring24.False.3": "Gus really rises to the occasion for every festival, doesn't he? The Eggfest food was great, but so are the treats he made for this.$11",
"Coriander.spring24.True.1": "I've been looking forward to this for a while now, Superstar.$7",
"Coriander.spring24.True.2": "You ready to dance, Superstar? Vertically, horizontally, whatever you want~$29",
"Coriander.spring24.True.3": "You're a teaser, you turn me on, you leave me burning and then you're gone~$31",
"Coriander.spring24.Accept": "Of course I'll dance with you, @!$35",
// LUAU 
"Coriander.summer11.False.1": "The music they're playing over the speakers right now is pretty cool, but how about we up the tempo?$15",
"Coriander.summer11.False.2": "What do you think the chances of getting a bellyache from the communal soup are?$3",
"Coriander.summer11.False.3": "Eloise and Hector hanging out is so cute - like one, happy family!$11",
"Coriander.summer11.True.1": "This is my favorite thing about living in The Valley. The sand, the surf, the music, the soup... And you, Superstar!$4",
"Coriander.summer11.True.2": "The sand makes me so sleepy - can you handle the sunscreen for me, so I don't burn?$4",
"Coriander.summer11.True.3": "You look great in swimwear, @. Maybe you and I can go for a dip once everyone's cleared out.$17",
// MOONLIGHT JELLIES
"Coriander.summer28.False.1": "This is the most beautiful thing I've ever seen. It's like, magic. Nobody told me The Valley was magic, or I would've come here a long time ago.$4",
"Coriander.summer28.False.2": "I don't care about the science of how these things glow - I'm already convinced it's sorcery or something. It's so beautiful.$7",
"Coriander.summer28.False.3": "I'm so moved by all this, I could cry. It's just so beautiful...$23",
"Coriander.summer28.True.1": "I thought getting to see the moonlight jellies was the gift all on it's own, but seeing them with you? It's a dream come true.$29",
"Coriander.summer28.True.2": "This is the most beautiful thing I've ever seen, Superstar. Nobody told me The Valley was magic, or I would've come here a long time ago.$34",
"Coriander.summer28.True.3": "It's so beautiful, Superstar. Almost as beautiful as you.$32",
// SDV FAIR
"Coriander.fall16.False.1": "I have a soft spot for fried carnival food. This is like, my dream scenario.$22",
"Coriander.fall16.False.2": "Guess who got sick last year eating so much fried garbage? ME! Guess who's going it again? ALSO ME.$15",
"Coriander.fall16.False.3": "Is anyone else worried about Puddles Pity Party over there, or is that just me?$3",
"Coriander.fall16.True.1": "Since you're a farmer and adventurer and all, I bet you have no trouble with the strength game...~$28",
"Coriander.fall16.True.2": "Would you still love me even if I devoured a small mountain of fried food and got sick from it?$3",
"Coriander.fall16.True.3": "It's been a while, but I'm STILL worried about that clown.$20",
// SPIRIT'S EVE
"Coriander.fall27.False.1": "This is the perfect setting for a horror movie - largely on account of the cage monsters waiting to bust out.$6",
"Coriander.fall27.False.2": "If I get lost in the maze, can't I just climb over a hedge? But what if there are slashers in there...$20",
"Coriander.fall27.False.3": "Ghost shaped cookies, pumpkin tarts, spider cake pops - all perfect, with a great soundtrack to boot!$1",
"Coriander.fall27.True.1": "I want to be 'Final Girl' material, but I wouldn't mind being rescued by a hot farmer either...$27",
"Coriander.fall27.True.2": "Oh no, I'm SO frightened, ahhh... oh no, terrible... spooky... hold me, Superstar!$28",
"Coriander.fall27.True.3": "I made lots of treats for the kids this year. I hope they like them. Don't worry, I've got one for you too - for later.$34",
// ICE FESTIVAL 
"Coriander.winter8.False.1": "You think if you stick a carrot and hat on one of these snowmen, he'll come to life?$17",
"Coriander.winter8.False.2": "Everyone's done a brilliant job on those ice sculptures. It's the most impressive part of this festival, honestly.$23",
"Coriander.winter8.False.3": "What if we did a huge fish fry? That would be so fun, and taste so good... nothing beats salmon baked in lemon, butter and garlic over an open fire.$22",
"Coriander.winter8.True.1": "My hands are terribly cold, can I put them in your pockets?$27",
"Coriander.winter8.True.2": "As much as I'd love to sneak off with you, it's WAY too cold...$11",
"Coriander.winter8.True.3": "This whole thing just makes me want to cuddle up by the fire. Some soft music playing, good food, snow on the windowsill...$7",
// WINTER STAR 
"Coriander.winter25.False.1": "I really wasn't sure how this event worked, so I panicked and made thirty Winter-themed goodie bags.$20",
"Coriander.winter25.False.2": "Gifts this year include: battle vest patches, true crime VHS tapes...several crates of coal...$10",
"Coriander.winter25.False.3": "There's so much love in the air, despite the chill! Everyone's so happy to be together, and it's really infectious.$11",
"Coriander.winter25.True.1": "You're the greatest gift I ever could have gotten, Superstar my Superstar. Thank you.$27",
"Coriander.winter25.True.2": "I've got your gift, but it'll have to wait until we get home. I'll give you a hint: it's in my top dresser drawer.$28",
"Coriander.winter25.True.3": "There's so much love in the air, despite the chill! Everyone's so happy to be together, but mostly I'm happy to be together with you.$29",
// RSV GATHERING 
"Coriander.fall20.False.1": "Obviously the girlies have this in the bag, but I can see why this festival make Hector and Val feel out of sorts.$2#$b#Looking forward to the concert later, though. I'm excited to see what Sam and crew can do.$1",
"Coriander.fall20.False.2": "Everyone's gonna do great at the show tonight. I've got a real good feeling about it.$6",
"Coriander.fall20.False.3": "I don't spend much time over in Ridgeside because it's far, but this festival is really fun. Good food and good music wins me over every time.$11",
"Coriander.fall20.True.1": "There's probably not much of a 'backstage', but if there was, I'd love to sneak off with you.$28",
"Coriander.fall20.True.2": "Sometimes I think about asking if I could play with the band, but I'd rather spend this time in the crowd with you.$35",
"Coriander.fall20.True.3": "Good food and good music wins me over every time, Superstar. Will you dance with me at the show tonight?$32",
// RSV EMBER OF RESOLUTIONS 
"Coriander.winter28.False.1": "This is such a beautiful gathering. And everyone here is so kind toward each other. It doesn't feel like being surrounded by strangers.$23",
"Coriander.winter28.False.2": "The trek up this mountain was something else, huh? It's worth it for the food and friends, though. But boy, is it cold!$17",
"Coriander.winter28.False.3": "Something tells me Hector isn't going to take kindly to the giant bonfire.$6",
"Coriander.winter28.True.1": "This is such a beautiful gathering, and I'm happy to be sharing it with you, Superstar.$33",
"Coriander.winter28.True.2": "...The trek up this mountain isn't really what I wanted to be huffing and puffing over tonight.$35",
"Coriander.winter28.True.3": "The fire will keep us warm, sure, but you do a perfect job of getting me hot all on your own.$29",
// CONVERSATION TOPICS 
"Coriander.CT.ValInjury": "What happened to Val? Oh my gosh, I hope they're okay! I should check in on them, since I live closest...$37", 
"Coriander.CT.EmeritusIntro": "Oh my gosh. That baby dinosaur? SO cute.$27", 
"Coriander.CT.ValMinibossBattle": "So you're saying you fought a giant... corrupted... crab monster? Sounds like your average Tuesday afternoon in East Scarp!$23",

}